 "text": "Hi, how have been? Of course. Early stage dementia can be really challenging for everyone involved. Would you like me to share some personal experience, or would you rather start with basics? Then let's go with basics. Stick with one room at first. Yes, and stick to familiar faces. Your dad needs reassurance right now. Start with a few key memories. A trip to the zoo, his favorite restaurant, a walk in the park. Keep it simple. Be prepared for setbacks. Your dad might get lost in the kitchen, or forget your name. It' part of the disease, not you.",
